    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The group *passed*, which is the other half of naming it. `twice` says" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// nothing about intervals: it takes whatever group it is handed and" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// composes an element with itself, and `g.compose(x, x)` reads the field" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// through the same spelling `P5.compose(P8)` reads the definition through." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The two are one operation — `interval_group.compose` **is**" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// `Interval::compose` — so the line below and `two_octaves` above compute" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// the same interval two ways." },
