    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// Written and not sounding. `c4` to `e4` is a major third and `c4` to" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// `fb4` is a diminished fourth, and the two agree in semitones — which is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// the whole reason this language keeps a spelling." },
