    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// What the round trip lands on, so the law is a value in the file rather" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// than a sentence about one — and a *sounded* value, so the fixture checks" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// it. The two notes of `law` are `arrived` and `e4`, and a `difference`" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// that answered the wrong interval would render them as two pitches." },
